  "problem": "Which of the following are affine transformations?\n\nI. ${T}_{1}:[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}u(u+1) \\\\ v+1\\end{aligned}]$\n\nII. ${T}_{2}:[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}v-2 \\\\ 5u-7\\end{aligned}]$\n\nIII. ${T}_{3}:[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}-v \\\\ -v\\end{aligned}]$",
